        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: The Telescopes, Candlelight Red, One Unique Signal\n- People: Stephen Lawrie\n- Places: Williamsport, Pennsylvania\n- Topics: album releases, band activity, live performance\n\nFacts:\n- The Telescopes debuted with the album \"Taste\" in 1989.\n- The Telescopes have released six albums in total since their 1989 debut.\n- Candlelight Red is a rock band from Williamsport, Pennsylvania.\n- Candlelight Red has released two studio albums and one EP.\n- Since 2010, One Unique Signal has performed live and recorded as The Telescopes alongside founder Stephen Lawrie.",
